            "electrical_reason": "The detector outputs feed the bases of the active HBT differential amplifier Xqag_p/Xqag_n, with the oa-biased MOS tail Xmnag. Its collector output is buffered by the HBT follower Xqagef and MOS bias device Xmnagef before reaching agc through Ragc_s and Cagc. Xsw_man is a PMOS pass device from mgc to gc enabled at mc=0, while Xsw_auto is an NMOS pass device from agc to gc enabled at mc=3.3 V; the sources are not directly shorted together. The independent manual and forced-agc selector tests confirm the intended selection paths."
